  "source": {
    "commit_when_pinned": "8574160fc065e505cdf0bffa49d67229181f6af5",
    "directory": "ppa-crosslayer/records/trials"
  },
  "what": "The five published cross-layer arms this re-adjudication is computed over, PINNED BY DIGEST. Nothing here is edited: the records are honest measurements and what changes is the verdict computed over them. `readjudicate.py` verifies every digest below before it reads a single number, so a re-adjudication over a modified record refuses rather than publishes.",
  "why_not_vendored": "An earlier revision of this directory carried byte-for-byte COPIES of these twenty files, because the arms lived on an unmerged branch. They landed on main in v1.11.66, so the copies became 964 KB of duplicate published record -- and worse, a digest pin that protected the copy rather than the record. The manifest now pins the real paths, so editing a published record is what the check catches."
}
